%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: GvantsaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Your booth has a hairline crack in the left panel. Wasn't there last
      week. Gvantsa Edisherashvili. Political science student, or I was, before
      the campus emptied.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I've been documenting changes at this checkpoint since week one. You
      process about four people every six minutes.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Why are you documenting that?
      npcResponse: Because nobody else is. If I stop recording, the data disappears.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: That sounds exhausting.
      npcResponse: It keeps me from thinking about everything else. Which is the
        point.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my mother and sister. My sister wanted to leave, my mother
      wouldn't. I stayed to keep count. Two notebooks so far. The entries keep
      getting shorter.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: Everyone here looks at their papers instead of at you. They've stopped
      trusting faces. Mine are here. Expiry's October, verified this morning.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What does that mean to you?
      npcResponse: It means faces are no longer reliable data. Worth noting.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: You're very observant.
      npcResponse: I notice everything. Not always useful. But it's all I have.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
